---
// Methodology section component - Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC) & Agile Practices
---

<section id="metodologia" class="py-20 bg-navy-900 text-white relative border-t border-navy-800">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold tracking-wider uppercase mb-2 block">Ingeniería Rigurosa</span>
            <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold mb-4">
                Nuestra Metodología de Desarrollo de Software
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-300">
                Aplicamos un ciclo de vida de desarrollo de software (SDLC) ágil y estructurado para garantizar productos escalables, seguros y entregados a tiempo.
            </p>
            <div class="w-24 h-1 bg-emerald-500 mx-auto mt-6 rounded"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- Timeline / SDLC Steps Grid -->
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-16">
            <!-- Step 1 -->
            <div class="bg-navy-800 p-8 rounded-xl border border-navy-700 hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 group">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
                    <span class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 font-extrabold flex items-center justify-center text-xl border border-emerald-500/20">01</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb text-3xl text-gray-500 group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">1. Descubrimiento & Análisis</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                    Definición de requerimientos del negocio, historias de usuario, prototipado UX/UI y especificación técnica de la arquitectura.
                </p>
                <ul class="text-xs text-gray-300 space-y-2">
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-400"></i> Diagramas C4 y Modelado DDD</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-400"></i> Wireframes y Prototipos interactivos</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Step 2 -->
            <div class="bg-navy-800 p-8 rounded-xl border border-navy-700 hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 group">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
                    <span class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-400 font-extrabold flex items-center justify-center text-xl border border-blue-500/20">02</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-sitemap text-3xl text-gray-500 group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">2. Arquitectura & Diseño Técnico</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                    Elección de patrones de diseño (Clean Architecture, Microservicios), modelado de base de datos SQL/NoSQL y diseño de APIs.
                </p>
                <ul class="text-xs text-gray-300 space-y-2">
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-blue-400"></i> Principios SOLID y Clean Code</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-blue-400"></i> Especificación OpenAPI/RESTful</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Step 3 -->
            <div class="bg-navy-800 p-8 rounded-xl border border-navy-700 hover:border-indigo-500/50 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 group">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
                    <span class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-400 font-extrabold flex items-center justify-center text-xl border border-indigo-500/20">03</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-code text-3xl text-gray-500 group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">3. Desarrollo Ágil (Scrum Sprints)</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                    Construcción iterativa en Sprints de 2 semanas con revisiones continuas, control de versiones Git y revisiones de código cruzadas.
                </p>
                <ul class="text-xs text-gray-300 space-y-2">
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-indigo-400"></i> Sprints de 14 días y Dailies</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-indigo-400"></i> Integración de IA & Co-pilots</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Step 4 -->
            <div class="bg-navy-800 p-8 rounded-xl border border-navy-700 hover:border-yellow-500/50 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 group">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
                    <span class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-yellow-500/10 text-yellow-400 font-extrabold flex items-center justify-center text-xl border border-yellow-500/20">04</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-vial-circle-check text-3xl text-gray-500 group-hover:text-yellow-400 transition-colors"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 group-hover:text-yellow-400 transition-colors">4. QA & Pruebas Automatizadas</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                    Aseguramiento de calidad riguroso mediante pruebas unitarias, de integración, rendimiento y auditoría de seguridad OWASP.
                </p>
                <ul class="text-xs text-gray-300 space-y-2">
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-yellow-400"></i> Unit Testing & Cypress/Playwright</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-yellow-400"></i> Pentesting y Seguridad API</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Step 5 -->
            <div class="bg-navy-800 p-8 rounded-xl border border-navy-700 hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 group">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
                    <span class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 font-extrabold flex items-center justify-center text-xl border border-emerald-500/20">05</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-cloud-arrow-up text-3xl text-gray-500 group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">5. Despliegue CI/CD & Cloud</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                    Automatización de despliegue continuo con contenedores Docker, Vercel y clusters Kubernetes en Amazon Web Services.
                </p>
                <ul class="text-xs text-gray-300 space-y-2">
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-400"></i> Pipelines automatizados en GitHub Actions</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-400"></i> Zero-Downtime Deployments</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Step 6 -->
            <div class="bg-navy-800 p-8 rounded-xl border border-navy-700 hover:border-purple-500/50 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 group">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
                    <span class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-400 font-extrabold flex items-center justify-center text-xl border border-purple-500/20">06</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line text-3xl text-gray-500 group-hover:text-purple-400 transition-colors"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 group-hover:text-purple-400 transition-colors">6. Monitoreo & Mantenimiento</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                    Supervisión 24/7 de disponibilidad, métricas APM, trazabilidad de errores en tiempo real y soporte técnico continuo.
                </p>
                <ul class="text-xs text-gray-300 space-y-2">
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-purple-400"></i> Telemetría y Alertas de rendimiento</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-purple-400"></i> Actualizaciones evolutivas</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Infographic Image Box -->
        <div class="bg-navy-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-navy-700 p-8 flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-8">
            <div class="lg:w-1/2">
                <img src="/images/sdlc-methodology.png" alt="Metodología de Desarrollo de Software SDLC" class="rounded-xl shadow-2xl w-full object-cover border border-navy-700" />
            </div>
            <div class="lg:w-1/2 space-y-4">
                <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold text-sm uppercase">Garantía de Calidad Técnica</span>
                <h3 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-white">¿Por qué elegir nuestra metodología?</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    No solo escribimos código: aplicamos ingeniería de software rigurosa. Reducimos el tiempo de salida al mercado (Time-to-Market), eliminamos la deuda técnica y garantizamos arquitectura lista para escalar desde el primer día.
                </p>
                <div class="pt-4">
                    <a href="#contacto" class="inline-block bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg transition-all shadow-lg shadow-emerald-900/30">
                        Consultar para tu Proyecto
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
